"Level, reputation, dispatch trust, driving record and CDL, balance and "
"debt, endorsements, lifetime numbers, and rest."
msgstr ""
"Nivel, reputación, confianza de despacho, historial de conducción y CDL, "
"saldo y deuda, habilitaciones, cifras totales y descanso."

