msgstr "Un deslizamiento rápido es un paso."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "A swipe and hold is continuous."
msgstr "Deslizar y mantener es continuo."

#. one sentence of a longer line
msgid "Gestures are named but do not control the truck."
msgstr "Los gestos se nombran pero no manejan el camión."

